  "title": "First Battle of Panipat",
  "summary": "At Panipat in April 1526 Babur, with roughly 12,000 men, defeated Ibrahim Lodi, Sultan of Delhi, whose army Babur was told numbered 100,000 though other sources say as few as 40,000. Ibrahim was killed. The victory opened Delhi and Agra to Babur and began Mughal rule in India.",
